DESCRIPTION:The goal of the F1rst-Gen Mentorship Initiative is to take a proactive and comprehensive approach to First-Generation student success focusing on early intervention\, wrap-around support\, and opportunities for intentional network building through campus engagement. First-Generation Students are those whose parents did not attend or complete college or those whose parents attended college outside of the U.S.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377322
