DESCRIPTION:Curious about AHA? Come learn what we're all about!\n\nJoin us for an interest meeting to learn more about the Asian Healthcare Association (AHA) and how to get involved. We'll cover our mission\, upcoming events\, leadership opportunities\, and how AHA supports students interested in Asian health\, culture\, and community within healthcare.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377209
