SUMMARY:SAAO & IM Club Guest Speaker: Dr. James Keane
LOCATION:Sahuaro B\,
DESCRIPTION:Please join SAAO and Internal Medicine Club in welcoming guest speaker\, Dr. James Keane. He is the medical director of the Osteopathic Medicine Center Arizona and an assistant professor at ATSU-SOMA. Dr. Keane will talk about his career as an osteopathic physician including his training in integrative holistic medicine and OMT. He is an alum of AZCOM.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377159
DTSTART:20260923T190000Z
