SUMMARY:Navigating the Business of Dentistry: Financial and Career Strategies for Future Practice Owners
LOCATION:Online Event
DESCRIPTION:Dental school prepares students to provide excellent patient care\, but many new graduates have limited exposure to the financial and operational aspects of running a successful practice. This presentation will provide a foundational overview of the business side of dentistry and help students better understand the opportunities and challenges they will encounter after graduation.\n\nMeeting Link: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/280602102197711?p=9VMPRPqbeVNpy1t225\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377223
